# covered by existing nodes (C1 ingestion pipeline, C3 storage principles,
# C4 search, C6 MCP role, C12 six memory-store roles, C13 source quality).
# Two comment patches landed above (C2 LifecycleStage terminal-stage gap;
# C5 ContentSubtype open-ended-ness). The remaining 5 nodes — four
